  m_Name: AllAcknowledgements
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Acknowledgement_string: "Game designed, built, and marketed by Dylan Brams\r\n\r\nI
    would like to thank / acknowledge:\r\n\r\nMy wife, for supporting me in making
    this game and follow a less profitable dream.\r\n\r\nWhomever the guy in Indonesia
    named WillNode is. He built the TexDraw package for Unity, without which this
    game would have taken much longer to produce.\r\n\r\nMatthew Welch, matt@squaregear.net;
    he created the font for the menu.\r\nWeb Address: http://www.squaregear.net/fonts/\r\n\r\nThe
    MusOpen.org project, ( https://musopen.org/team/ ) for doing something amazing.\r\nSpecific
    musicians / groups who have contributed to MusOpen or made their performances
    public domain, which may include:\r\n\tIvan Ilic\r\n\tPapalin\r\n\tThe Czech
    National Symphony Orchestra\r\n\tThe US Army Strings Band\r\n\tThe US Air Force
    Band\r\n\tThe European Archive\r\n\tThe Advent Chamber Orchestra\r\n\r\nThe SymPy
    team for writing clean code. I did not use their code directly, but my equations
    library borrowed from it.\r\n\r\nShould this game sell a significant number of
    copies, I will distribute a portion of the profits to these deserving entities.\r\n"
